        "title": "Avatar: Frontiers of Pandora",
        "extract": "Avatar: Frontiers of Pandora is a 2023 action-adventure game developed by Massive Entertainment and published by Ubisoft. The game is part of the Avatar franchise, and was released for PlayStation 5, Windows, and Xbox Series X/S on December 7, 2023. It received mixed reviews from critics. Ubisoft supported the game with several downloadable content (DLC) packs including The Sky Breaker in July 2024, Secrets of the Spires in November 2024, and Avatar: From the Ashes in December 19, 2025.",
